      "label": "A Black family celebrating the 4th of July in patriotic attire",
      "description": "The scene depicts a happy Black family — a man, a woman, and a young girl — dressed in American flag-themed clothing, posing together outdoors in front of a building with an American flag. The family is smiling and appears joyful, suggesting a celebration of the 4th of July. The text overlay reinforces the context of celebrating American independence day.",
